---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageShell from "../components/layout/PageShell.astro";
import { site } from "../content/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms of Use for the Pathwisse public website at pathwisse.com"
>
  <PageShell>
    <article class="legal-page">
      <header class="legal-page__header">
        <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
        <p class="legal-page__date">Last updated: 20 September 2026</p>
      </header>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>1. About these terms</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Use apply to your visit and use of the Pathwisse public
          website at <strong>https://pathwisse.com</strong>. By accessing or
          using the website, you agree to comply with these terms.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you do not agree with these terms, please do not use the website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>2. About Pathwisse</h2>
        <p>
          Pathwisse is built and maintained by{" "}
          <strong>Shaquantum Labs Private Limited</strong>, a company based in
          Hyderabad, India.
        </p>
        <p>
          The public website presents information about Pathwisse, its approach,
          and ways to contact the team.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>3. Informational purpose of the website</h2>
        <p>
          The Pathwisse public website is provided as an informational resource.
          It presents:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Information about Pathwisse and our approach</li>
          <li>Content about our vision and principles</li>
          <li>Information about programs and educational concepts</li>
          <li>Ways to contact the Pathwisse team</li>
          <li>Links to the separate Pathwisse application</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Website content may evolve, be updated, or be removed as Pathwisse
          develops.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>4. No employment, placement, or outcome guarantees</h2>
        <p>
          Pathwisse does <strong>not</strong> guarantee:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>employment or job placement</li>
          <li>internship opportunities</li>
          <li>salary or compensation</li>
          <li>admission to educational programs</li>
          <li>hiring outcomes of any kind</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Participation in Pathwisse is intended to support the development of
          student capability and preparation. Outcomes depend on many factors
          outside our control.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>5. No professional advice</h2>
        <p>
          The information on this website is not professional advice, such as:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>legal advice</li>
          <li>career counseling</li>
          <li>academic direction</li>
          <li>medical or psychological advice</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          For matters requiring professional guidance, consult with a qualified
          professional in that field.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>6. Permitted website use</h2>
        <p>
          You may use the website for informational purposes only. You agree not
          to:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Reproduce or republish content without permission</li>
          <li>Use the website for commercial purposes</li>
          <li>Attempt to hack, overwhelm, or disrupt the website</li>
          <li>Scrape or automatically collect content at scale</li>
          <li>Impersonate Pathwisse or Shaquantum Labs</li>
          <li>Use the website in any way that violates applicable law</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>7. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          The website content, design, copy, visuals, and materials are owned by
          or used by Shaquantum Labs Private Limited, subject to applicable
          intellectual property rights and licenses.
        </p>
        <p>
          You may not copy, modify, or reproduce website content without
          permission, except as permitted by applicable fair-use laws.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>8. External links</h2>
        <p>
          The website may contain links to external services and content not
          controlled by Pathwisse or Shaquantum Labs. We are not responsible for
          external content, services, or practices of linked websites or
          applications.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>9. Accuracy and availability</h2>
        <p>
          We strive to keep the website current and accurate. However, we make
          no guarantee that all information is complete, accurate, or
          error-free.
        </p>
        <p>
          The website is provided on an "as-is" basis. We may modify, suspend,
          or discontinue the website or its services at any time with or without
          notice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>10. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the extent permitted by applicable law, Shaquantum Labs Private
          Limited and the Pathwisse website are provided without warranties of
          any kind, either expressed or implied.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are not liable for damages or losses arising from your use of the
          website, including:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Loss of data, revenue, or opportunity</li>
          <li>Indirect, consequential, or punitive damages</li>
          <li>Service interruptions or inaccurate information</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          This limitation applies to the fullest extent permitted by applicable
          law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>11. Changes to the website or terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this website and these Terms of Use at any time. The
          "Last updated" date at the top of this page indicates when these terms
          were most recently revised.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your continued use of the website after updates constitutes acceptance
          of the new terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>12. Governing law</h2>
        <p>These Terms of Use are governed by the applicable laws of India.</p>
        <p>
          Any legal proceedings arising from these terms or the website will be
          subject to the jurisdiction of courts in India in accordance with
          applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>13. Separate terms for the Pathwisse application</h2>
        <p>
          These website Terms do not automatically govern the separate
          authenticated Pathwisse application at https://app.pathwisse.com.
        </p>
        <p>
          The application may be subject to separate terms and conditions if or
          when those are published.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <h2>14. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about these Terms of Use, please contact:</p>
        <p class="legal-page__contact">
          <strong>Email:</strong>
          <br />
          <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Shaquantum Labs Private Limited</strong>
          <br />
          # 8-2-610/A/401
          <br />
          4th Floor
          <br />
          Silver Tower Banjara
          <br />
          Banjara Hills Road No. 11
          <br />
          Hyderabad - 500034
          <br />
          Telangana
          <br />
          India
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-page__section">
        <p class="legal-page__disclaimer">
          <strong>Note:</strong> These Terms of Use are a production draft
          intended to accurately describe the Pathwisse public website and
          applicable limitations. They are pending professional legal review. If
          you have legal questions, please contact the company directly.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </PageShell>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: var(--width-reading);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-6);
  }
  .legal-page__header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }
  .legal-page h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }
  .legal-page__date {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-small);
  }
  .legal-page__section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
  }
  .legal-page h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .legal-page h2 + p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .legal-page p,
  .legal-page ul,
  .legal-page li {
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .legal-page p {
    margin: var(--space-3) 0;
  }
  .legal-page ul {
    margin: var(--space-3) 0;
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
  }
  .legal-page li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }
  .legal-page a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .legal-page a:visited {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .legal-page a:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .legal-page__contact {
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-primary);
  }
  .legal-page__disclaimer {
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .legal-page {
      padding: var(--space-4);
    }
    .legal-page__section {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    }
  }
</style>
